@section home_family_apis Family API references

Each family has its own complete Doxygen reference, generated from that
family's public headers and sources:

<table>
<tr><th>Family</th><th>ISA / core</th><th>Archive</th><th>API reference</th></tr>
<tr>
<td>CH32V002 / 003 / 004 / 005 / 006 / 007</td>
<td>RV32EC, QingKe V2</td>
<td><code>libopenwch_ch32v0.a</code></td>
<td><a href="../ch32v0/html/index.html">CH32V00x API</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>CH582 / CH583 / CH584 / CH585</td>
<td>RV32IMAC, QingKe V4</td>
<td><code>libopenwch_ch5xx58x.a</code></td>
<td><a href="../ch5xx58x/html/index.html">CH58x API</a></td>
</tr>
</table>

The family sites are self-contained: each has its own search index, source
browser, group hierarchy, and Doxygen Awesome light/dark theme.  This root
site supplies the cross-family overview and the module map.

@section home_status Current scope

<table>
<tr><th>Area</th><th>Status</th></tr>
<tr><td>CH32V00x drivers</td><td>15 peripherals, full public API, API smoke link</td></tr>
<tr><td>CH58x drivers</td><td>12 peripherals, RWA-safe access, API smoke link</td></tr>
<tr><td>QingKe core</td><td>vectors, reset path, PFIC/NVIC, SysTick, DWT, CSR, assertions</td></tr>
<tr><td>mini-libc</td><td>optional freestanding string/memory archive per family</td></tr>
<tr><td>BLE</td><td>peripheral-role wrapper over WCH's Apache-2.0 binary stack</td></tr>
<tr><td>Documentation</td><td>per-family API sites plus this root site, with Chinese root pages</td></tr>
<tr><td>Hardware-in-the-loop</td><td>partial: CH32V003 SPI NOR CRC, <code>wchlink</code> GDB software breakpoints, DMA MEM2MEM self-test, TIM1/TIM2 period self-tests, and IWDG/WWDG self-test verified; blink/UART, full flashing, and CH58x remain pending</td></tr>
</table>

@section home_doc_build Building this documentation

From the library root:

@code
make html
@endcode

This writes the root site to <code>doc/html/index.html</code>, the CH32V00x
reference to <code>doc/ch32v0/html/index.html</code>, and the CH58x reference
to <code>doc/ch5xx58x/html/index.html</code>.  Doxygen warnings are collected
in <code>doc/doxygen-root.log</code> and
<code>doc/&lt;family&gt;/doxygen.log</code>; the build skips cleanly when
Doxygen is not installed.
*/
